px_040126_Cape.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1989/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Cape.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1989/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Cape.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1989/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Cape.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1989/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Cape.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1989/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Cape.jpg","John Doyle, CEO","Cape is rebuilding the mobile network stack with privacy at its core by replacing legacy carrier infrastructure with its own secure mobile core and custom SIMs. By decoupling identity from connectivity through anonymous authentication and unlinkable payment, Cape protects users at the network layer, not just the app layer. In a world where mobile infrastructure was never designed for privacy, we believe Cape is defining a new standard for secure connectivity.","Cape | IVP","America’s leading privacy-first mobile carrier ",{"id":31,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"1986","2026-03-19","John Doyle, Nicholas Espinoza","/content/cape-security-at-the-mobile-core/","Read the Funding Announcement ","https://www.linkedin.com/company/capecellular/posts/?feedView=all",{"id":38,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":39,"assetUrlXs":40,"assetUrlSm":41,"assetUrlMd":42,"assetUrlLg":43,"assetUrlXl":44,"assetUrlXxl":45},"1987","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/xs_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/sm_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/md_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/lg_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/xl_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/1987/xxl_Cape_logo_for_IVP.com.jpg","Founded 2022\r\nPartnered 2026","Cape","The telecommunications industry was built on a trade-off between connectivity and privacy—a trade-off that is no longer acceptable in today’s security landscape. At Cape, we’ve rebuilt the mobile core from the ground up to restore user agency and eliminate the data vulnerabilities inherent in traditional telco networks. Partnering with IVP, a firm with an impeccable track record of scaling category-defining companies, gives us the resources to bring this secure-by-design connectivity to everyone. We are thrilled to work with them.","cape",{"id":51,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"1985",{"name":53,"slug":54},"Active","active",[56,59,62,65,68],{"fullName":57,"slug":58},"Somesh Dash","somesh-dash",{"fullName":60,"slug":61},"Eric Liaw","eric-liaw",{"fullName":63,"slug":64},"Zeya Yang","zeya-yang",{"fullName":66,"slug":67},"Bala Sathiamurthy","bala-sathiamurthy",{"fullName":69,"slug":70},"Cynthia Lai","cynthia-lai","https://x.com/CapeCellular","https://www.cape.co/",1790351909943]